WEBVTT

00:06:58.280 --> 00:07:02.976
and that book led to another book,
and another book, and another book,

00:07:03.000 --> 00:07:05.256
and another book, and another book,

00:07:05.280 --> 00:07:06.976
and another book, and another book,

00:07:07.000 --> 00:07:10.336
and another book, and another book,
and another book, and another book,

00:07:10.360 --> 00:07:13.696
and another book, and another book,
and another book, and another book,

00:07:13.720 --> 00:07:15.976
and another book,
and another book, and another.

00:07:16.000 --> 00:07:17.736
(Applause)

00:07:17.760 --> 00:07:19.096
And throughout my life,

00:07:19.120 --> 00:07:22.656
she's edited and published dozens of books

00:07:22.680 --> 00:07:27.376
and curated numerous exhibitions
on every continent,

00:07:27.400 --> 00:07:30.936
not all about black photographers
but all inspired by the curiosity